WEBVTT

00:00.840 --> 00:05.510
Hi, all. I'm still here
and still doing great.

00:05.230 --> 00:08.679
Dolphin & Whale Studies

00:05.850 --> 00:08.430
Now that I've made it
through my college midterms,

00:08.680 --> 00:12.600
it's full speed ahead to a
long-awaited summer break!

00:17.900 --> 00:20.489
Is this really okay?

00:20.490 --> 00:21.490
Whoa!

00:21.491 --> 00:22.989
It's a bit small.

00:22.990 --> 00:25.330
It's really cute, Fuuri.

00:25.450 --> 00:28.500
I sure do have a knack for choosing things.

00:28.830 --> 00:35.459
That swimsuit really expresses your
natural charms! Not to get into specifics.

00:35.460 --> 00:36.750
And next!

00:37.710 --> 00:39.510
Yup, it's my turn!

00:41.550 --> 00:43.390
Suzu, it's so daring!

00:44.680 --> 00:47.510
Summer is the time for girls to be daring.

00:48.060 --> 00:50.389
Is it summer that manipulates the girl?

00:50.390 --> 00:55.730
Or is it the girl that reacts to summer?
That's the difficult part, huh?

00:55.980 --> 00:58.280
I get it. How philosophical!

00:58.530 --> 00:59.650
And now...

01:00.190 --> 01:01.190
Last, we have...

01:01.530 --> 01:03.200
our very own Nico!

01:04.360 --> 01:07.830
Nico, that's such an adorable one-piece!

01:08.120 --> 01:12.790
With Suzu picking it, I
thought it'd be more daring.

01:13.040 --> 01:14.210
Um, actually...

01:15.960 --> 01:18.250
That is the foolish thinking of an amateur!

01:18.750 --> 01:22.380
Nico has a great figure, so hiding
it a little is just the thing.

01:22.720 --> 01:23.720
However!

01:24.050 --> 01:27.390
The real sexiness is hiding here in back!

01:27.850 --> 01:31.139
Whoa! Literally covering the front
while leaving the rear exposed!

01:31.140 --> 01:34.940
Exactly. At first glance, you
have a pure, adorable girl.

01:35.310 --> 01:40.440
But here, her true nature as a voluptuous
woman lies hidden! That's the concept.

01:40.730 --> 01:43.699
Suzu, that's kind of a weird concept!

01:43.700 --> 01:49.950
It's all about setting the tone, you know. Nico,
tomorrow isn't just a fun day at the beach!

01:50.580 --> 01:52.500
We're also there to advertise
our next regular show.

01:52.500 --> 01:55.170
We're also there to advertise
our next regular show.

01:52.501 --> 01:54.880
FIRST ASTRONOMICAL VELOCITY
Regular Live Show

01:55.540 --> 01:59.500
We need to attract the
attention of every person we can.

01:59.880 --> 02:01.920
That's why this is necessary!

02:02.300 --> 02:04.010
B-but...

02:05.590 --> 02:10.059
Nico, if you don't go along with this,

02:10.060 --> 02:13.930
it's possible she'll come up with an
even MORE embarrassing swimsuit.

02:19.650 --> 02:22.479
I'll wear this and do my best!

02:22.480 --> 02:26.149
Okay! Let's make a splash
at the beach tomorrow!

02:26.150 --> 02:27.660
YEAH!

02:31.740 --> 02:32.950
Looks like...

02:33.790 --> 02:37.000
the weather decided to
make a splash before us.

02:41.290 --> 02:42.799
Ippai hibiki MUSIC
Ring out, tons of music

02:42.800 --> 02:44.299
Ippai kimari POSING
Do tons of cool posing

02:44.300 --> 02:45.799
Ippai todoke FEELING
Let tons of feelings reach you

02:45.800 --> 02:47.299
Super Soni let's go!
Super Soni let's go!

02:47.300 --> 02:48.759
Suggoi shigeki tenkomori
Stimulation super piling up

02:48.760 --> 02:50.276
Suggoi tama ni karamawari
Sometimes super running in circles

02:50.300 --> 02:51.889
Suggoi kimi to zutto ENJOY
Always super enjoy being with you

02:51.890 --> 02:54.140
Super Soni LET'S GO! Desu
Super Soni let's go! Yes

03:06.110 --> 03:10.570
Saikin omoitsukimashita
Lately, I've come to realize

03:12.200 --> 03:16.540
Kimochi tsutaeru tte taihen
That getting feelings across is tough

03:18.290 --> 03:23.089
Umaku dekitari dekinattari
Whether it goes well or not

03:23.090 --> 03:26.839
Muzukashii kara oku no te de
Is tough, so my trump card

03:26.840 --> 03:29.430
Mouretsu taiatari desu
Is going for it at full force

03:31.180 --> 03:33.470
Dakedo hitomishiri (hitomishiri)
But I'm shy (shy)

03:34.100 --> 03:36.900
Gomakashite senobi (senobi)
I act like it's nothing and aim high (high)

03:37.270 --> 03:38.809
Ashi ga gakuburu de
With legs trembling

03:38.810 --> 03:42.060
Hirakinaotte arinomama GO!
I get serious and just go for it!

03:42.440 --> 03:45.069
Zenkai, soukai, daitenkai Recuperation,
exhilaration, a big revolution

03:45.070 --> 03:48.110
Nandemo chokushin STRAIGHT
No matter what, keep heading straight

03:48.450 --> 03:51.109
Sekai, mankai, mugendai
The world, in full bloom, infinity

03:51.110 --> 03:54.659
Kyou mo genki ni koko ni imasu (HEY!) I'm
here again today, living to the fullest (Hey!)

03:54.660 --> 03:56.176
Ippai hibike MUSIC
Ring out, tons of music

03:56.200 --> 03:57.619
Ippai kimari POSING
Do tons of cool posing

03:57.620 --> 03:59.266
Ippai todoke FEELING?
Let tons of feelings reach you

03:59.290 --> 04:00.539
Super Soni let's go!
Super Soni let's go!

04:00.540 --> 04:02.209
Suggoi shigeki tenkomori
Stimulation super piling up

04:02.210 --> 04:03.539
Suggoi tama ni karamawari
Sometimes super running in circles

04:03.540 --> 04:05.356
Suggoi kimi to zutto ENJOY
Always super enjoy being with you

04:05.380 --> 04:07.550
SUPER SONI LET'S GO! Desu
Super Soni let's go! Yes

04:17.890 --> 04:21.270
With just an application, your cellulite...

04:22.020 --> 04:23.770
burns up and disappears.

04:24.610 --> 04:27.230
Just dab it on your trouble areas!

04:27.650 --> 04:29.530
It's the ultimate diet...

04:30.360 --> 04:32.700
Shibou Moelle from Shiboudo!

04:33.320 --> 04:36.200
Making every woman her most beautiful.

04:37.160 --> 04:41.330
Oh. This is the commercial
they're airing next month?

04:41.830 --> 04:43.670
That's amazing, Ouka!

04:44.330 --> 04:48.050
I can't believe you landed a
nationwide TV commercial.

04:48.460 --> 04:50.510
It really is amazing!

04:51.140 --> 04:52.259
Iwasa Parlor

04:52.260 --> 04:56.760
Thinking back on all those boring jobs like storefront
presenter and flyer model that I've done up till now...

04:57.060 --> 05:02.190
I often want to kill my manager.

05:02.730 --> 05:06.400
And yet! At long last,
my flower has bloomed!

05:07.190 --> 05:10.240
The Age of Ouka has finally come!

05:11.240 --> 05:15.239
Whoa! Congratulations. That's wonderful.

05:15.240 --> 05:17.870
I'm really happy for you, Ouka!

05:18.950 --> 05:21.500
If you want my autograph,
now's the time to ask!

05:22.040 --> 05:26.000
Still, I'm impressed we
managed to land a job this big.

05:26.540 --> 05:30.420
Actually, I was scouted for the
commercial from a storefront job.

05:30.920 --> 05:35.720
They scouted someone for a national
ad campaign from a storefront?

05:36.090 --> 05:38.760
Well, such is the power of Ouka Appeal!

05:39.310 --> 05:40.350
Here you go.

05:40.350 --> 05:42.480
Ah, thank you very much!

05:40.351 --> 05:42.310
Too Sonico Ouka

05:43.140 --> 05:49.520
Oh, Sonico, I'm doing a Shibou Moelle live
product demo the day after tomorrow.

05:49.980 --> 05:55.109
Would you like to come, too?
You can bring your friends, if you like.

05:55.110 --> 05:56.820
Wow! Is that okay?

05:57.070 --> 06:03.250
No problem. I'm getting the VIP treatment!
And the presentation is on...

06:03.460 --> 06:06.419
get this: a super luxury liner!

06:06.420 --> 06:09.879
Wha, wha, wha?! Wow! Definitely!

06:09.880 --> 06:11.760
Please let me come!

06:11.761 --> 06:14.220
CRUISING OF
THE DEAD

06:15.760 --> 06:18.390
Wow, that's amazing!

06:19.010 --> 06:22.890
Everyone on a ship like
that must be celebrities.

06:23.560 --> 06:25.730
It seems only natural, huh?

06:29.900 --> 06:31.860
I-it's huge!

06:33.150 --> 06:34.740
And pretty.

06:35.400 --> 06:37.200
Such luxury!

06:37.490 --> 06:41.369
Did you see? They have an indoor hot
spring and movie theater!

06:41.370 --> 06:43.750
And a tennis court and a casino!

06:44.000 --> 06:51.210
And a huge restaurant and sushi bar, too! I
can't wait to try all the different foods.

06:51.540 --> 06:55.340
Why... Why is the world so unfair?!

06:55.880 --> 06:58.050
This is... This is...

06:58.590 --> 07:02.010
how celebrities live, isn't it?!

07:09.230 --> 07:11.610
Kimi wa kimi ni dekiru koto
You do what you can

07:11.900 --> 07:14.070
Boku wa boku ni dekiru koto
I do what I can

07:14.530 --> 07:16.850
Kotae nante nakute iinda
There doesn't have to be an answer

07:17.110 --> 07:19.871
Atarashii asu mitsukete yo, RIGHT NOW!
Find a new tomorrow, right now!

07:24.790 --> 07:27.306
Hashire, hashire, zutto mirai
Run, run, forever toward the future

07:27.330 --> 07:29.670
Kimi wa boku no LUCKY STAR
You are my lucky star

07:29.960 --> 07:32.170
Boku wa kimi no HAPPY STAR
I am your happy star

07:35.340 --> 07:37.630
Yeah yeah, yeah yeah yeah

07:40.470 --> 07:42.720
Yeah yeah, yeah yeah yeah

07:44.430 --> 07:46.140
Yeah yeah, yeah yeah

07:50.310 --> 07:52.410
Shibou
Moelle
Product
Demonstrtion

07:55.530 --> 07:59.200
Whoa, whoa! Everyone is so fashionable!

08:00.110 --> 08:03.490
It's like, we're the only
ones out of place here...

08:05.450 --> 08:06.830
I-I'm sorry!

08:07.120 --> 08:08.870
No, my apologies.

08:11.170 --> 08:13.290
Forgive the delay, ladies and gentlemen.

08:14.380 --> 08:20.800
We will now begin the demonstration of
Shiboudo's newest product, Shibou Moelle.

08:21.470 --> 08:26.349
But first, let's meet Shiboudo's
CEO, Kabuko Joujoji,

08:26.350 --> 08:31.480
along with the star of our television
commercial, Miss Ouka Satsurikuin.

08:34.480 --> 08:36.690
Ouka looks fabulous!

08:39.190 --> 08:44.620
Thank you for the introduction.
I am Kabuko Joujoji, CEO of Shiboudo.

08:45.410 --> 08:51.960
Well, let's dispense with the formalities. Allow
me to present our company's latest product.

08:52.830 --> 08:55.080
It's quite simple to use.

08:55.670 --> 09:00.970
Just rub it into any area you'd like
to see slimmed down. That is all!

09:01.550 --> 09:03.260
Please have a look!

09:04.430 --> 09:12.430
This was me, one month ago. And here
I am now, after using Shibou Moelle.

09:14.270 --> 09:22.110
Even Ouka here was able to achieve
her slender body thanks to Shibou Moelle.

09:22.820 --> 09:24.279
Right, Ouka?

09:24.280 --> 09:25.200
Yes!

09:25.201 --> 09:28.580
It's all thanks to Shibou Moelle!

09:30.580 --> 09:32.960
Uh, I was already slender...

09:33.330 --> 09:39.800
We've prepared various product types for you.
Please, try them out in the privacy of your cabins.

09:40.050 --> 09:42.880
Members of the crew,
please also try them if you like.

09:43.680 --> 09:48.050
Shibou Moelle will start
showing results in six hours.

09:48.470 --> 09:54.560
I look forward to seeing the beauty you've
achieved when we meet back here tomorrow!

09:56.810 --> 09:59.070
What was with that lady CEO?

09:59.690 --> 10:01.689
It all stunk to high heaven!

10:01.690 --> 10:06.489
Suzu. They invited us here,
so you shouldn't say that.

10:06.490 --> 10:10.210
- - USAGE: Apply as needed by hand, once daily. Takes effect in 6 hours. Effects
last for 3 hours. WARNING: Read all instructions carefully. Avoid sunlight and...

10:10.213 --> 10:13.540
"Takes effect in six hours.
Effects last for three hours," huh?

10:15.250 --> 10:18.210
Nico, are you seriously
thinking of using that stuff?

10:19.340 --> 10:23.129
Uh, well, there are a couple
things I'm worried about...

10:23.130 --> 10:25.839
Just don't do it. That
stuff can't be trusted.

10:25.840 --> 10:30.470
That's right. You're super
attractive the way you are!

10:30.680 --> 10:32.639
Huh? You think so?

10:32.640 --> 10:33.850
Of course!

10:34.100 --> 10:36.059
It's about dinnertime!

10:36.060 --> 10:39.899
If we don't hurry, it will all get eaten!

10:39.900 --> 10:41.270
No, it won't.

10:43.400 --> 10:48.950
You may be the CEO, but filming a commercial
and holding a product demo on your own...

10:49.410 --> 10:55.659
Shibou Moelle is still in the trial phase. We
need more testing to make sure it's safe to...

10:55.660 --> 11:00.879
What are you saying? Isn't my body
proof enough that it works?

11:00.880 --> 11:05.510
Results inevitably vary!
And there may be side effects.

11:05.760 --> 11:07.550
The project will continue.

11:07.840 --> 11:14.270
We've sunk all of our resources into
Shibou Moelle. There's no turning back now.

11:14.390 --> 11:15.390
But...!

11:15.930 --> 11:18.940
You worry too much. It'll be fine.

11:19.900 --> 11:24.860
With Shibou Moelle, you've created
what every woman has yearned for...

11:25.610 --> 11:29.200
a dream product that lets them be thin!

11:30.200 --> 11:33.700
This cream will secure
our names in history...

11:34.240 --> 11:38.750
As the saviors of women across the world,
the pioneers of beauty!

11:43.420 --> 11:48.760
I can't eat any more... But gimme some.

11:54.720 --> 11:56.350
What are you doin' out here all alone?

11:57.230 --> 11:58.270
Suzu!

11:59.140 --> 12:00.140
Something wrong?

12:00.141 --> 12:02.520
No, it's nothing.

12:03.480 --> 12:08.740
I'm just thinking how glad I am to have
such a nice vacation with you and Fuuri.

12:09.110 --> 12:09.780
Yeah.

12:09.990 --> 12:15.080
Suzu, thanks so much for
inviting me to join the band.

12:15.910 --> 12:18.580
Thank you for being with me.

12:18.960 --> 12:21.830
Wh-what's got into you? Jeez!

12:22.580 --> 12:24.789
Huh? You're getting embarrassed!

12:24.790 --> 12:26.210
N-no way!

12:28.300 --> 12:29.300
Hm?

12:32.680 --> 12:33.680
What's that about?

12:33.970 --> 12:35.510
I-I don't know.

12:36.260 --> 12:37.470
Think it's a burglar?

12:38.350 --> 12:40.270
Just kidding. There's no way it's...

13:07.300 --> 13:09.420
S-S-S-Suzu!

13:10.630 --> 13:11.969
What are they?

13:11.970 --> 13:15.300
It's... They're like zombies!

13:17.720 --> 13:18.770
That's...

13:19.930 --> 13:21.230
I-I'm sorry!

13:22.060 --> 13:25.229
That lady was at the
Shibou Moelle demonstration!

13:25.230 --> 13:26.230
Huh?

13:26.480 --> 13:29.650
It's definitely her. But
she's a lot thinner now.

13:29.980 --> 13:33.820
You think using that weird
medicine made them like this?

13:34.740 --> 13:39.080
They got too thin, and now they're
so hungry they're doing THIS?

13:40.790 --> 13:42.090
POTATO SLICES

13:42.160 --> 13:43.250
Don't tell me!

13:43.500 --> 13:48.590
U-um... I really don't
think I'd taste very good.

13:51.880 --> 13:53.880
Atmospheric Entry-Style...

13:54.880 --> 13:57.140
DROP KICK!

14:02.230 --> 14:04.939
Don't mess with a would-be pro wrestler.

14:04.940 --> 14:06.059
Suzu!

14:06.060 --> 14:08.310
Nico! Let's run for it while we can!

14:08.520 --> 14:09.520
Okay!

14:09.610 --> 14:11.570
Shoot! We're out of service range!

14:15.820 --> 14:18.660
Oh, no. The crew, too!

14:19.030 --> 14:21.660
Jeez. They all got too thin!

14:21.950 --> 14:23.200
I hope Fuuri's okay...

14:24.830 --> 14:26.000
That voice!

14:27.670 --> 14:28.920
Please don't!

14:29.170 --> 14:33.919
I like eating, but I really
don't want to be eaten!

14:33.920 --> 14:35.630
Atmospheric Entry-Style...

14:36.380 --> 14:40.760
DOUBLE DROP KICK!

14:46.520 --> 14:47.939
Suzu!

14:47.940 --> 14:50.229
Fuuri! Are you okay?

14:50.230 --> 14:51.610
N-Nico!

14:52.190 --> 14:54.530
I was so scared!

14:55.740 --> 14:57.910
We can't stay aboard this ship.

14:59.120 --> 15:01.280
We're getting out of here on a life boat!

15:04.000 --> 15:07.500
Ah! There's one! A life boat!

15:09.080 --> 15:10.420
Please wait!

15:10.630 --> 15:12.919
Let us on, too!

15:12.920 --> 15:14.129
Please, stop!

15:14.130 --> 15:14.880
Sonico!

15:14.880 --> 15:15.880
Ouka!

15:16.050 --> 15:19.300
I've already pressed the release switch.

15:19.640 --> 15:21.849
Hurry up, Sonico!

15:21.850 --> 15:22.850
Okay!

15:27.020 --> 15:28.309
Look at them all!

15:28.310 --> 15:31.480
Why do they just keep following us?!

15:31.940 --> 15:35.860
They're all so thin that
they're crazy from hunger!

15:36.280 --> 15:38.570
Is one of you carrying any food?

15:38.950 --> 15:41.410
Food? I don't have any.

15:41.780 --> 15:43.490
No, me neither.

15:43.740 --> 15:46.579
I get hungry when I'm nervous.

15:46.580 --> 15:47.750
No way!

15:50.250 --> 15:52.669
Fuuri, please drop the snacks!

15:52.670 --> 15:54.499
Huh? But why?

15:54.500 --> 15:58.259
Just drop 'em! Which is more
important, snacks or your life?!

15:58.260 --> 16:00.550
Both, of course.

16:03.300 --> 16:04.640
Sonico!

16:06.020 --> 16:14.020
The good times we shared together
will forever remain in my memory banks!

16:14.820 --> 16:19.070
Come on! Don't make it sound
like this is goodbye forever!

16:19.650 --> 16:21.070
You there!

16:22.070 --> 16:23.070
You!

16:23.410 --> 16:27.410
Get up here! Deck 10, Cabin 103!

16:28.500 --> 16:30.210
Hey, wait up!

16:36.170 --> 16:37.840
That was close...

16:38.800 --> 16:40.589
Thank you very much!

16:40.590 --> 16:43.390
You all will be safe in here.

16:43.800 --> 16:44.760
Please, relax.

16:44.761 --> 16:47.969
Dammit! Just what have you made?!

16:47.970 --> 16:50.229
Look at what it's done to everyone!

16:50.230 --> 16:53.190
I-it never did this to me.

16:53.560 --> 16:56.270
To think the effects
could vary so greatly...

16:56.690 --> 16:59.690
The only one it works right on is YOU!

17:01.200 --> 17:06.620
Um, isn't there some way to turn
those zombie-people back to normal?

17:07.280 --> 17:12.580
Shibou Moelle takes effect in six
hours and lasts for three.

17:13.120 --> 17:17.670
Assuming they applied it right after the
demonstration, it should wear off around midnight.

17:18.210 --> 17:21.090
Then everyone will go back to normal?

17:21.470 --> 17:23.759
Finally, a glimmer of hope.

17:23.760 --> 17:25.720
But what if they DON'T go back?

17:26.010 --> 17:29.929
In that case, we wait
here until rescuers arrive.

17:29.930 --> 17:32.560
Rescuers? How long
should we wait for that?!

17:32.850 --> 17:35.690
The ship's anchored and
we're out of cell phone range!

17:35.900 --> 17:38.610
Besides, there's no food or water in here.

17:39.280 --> 17:40.609
Yes, there is.

17:40.610 --> 17:42.150
COME ON!

17:56.290 --> 17:57.290
Ms. President!

17:57.460 --> 18:00.760
I'll be fine. Just get out of here, fast!

18:05.510 --> 18:08.219
My precious snacks!

18:08.220 --> 18:09.390
Forget them and run!

18:14.190 --> 18:15.390
This way!

18:18.440 --> 18:20.020
Down! We're going down!

18:25.070 --> 18:26.159
STORAGE

18:26.160 --> 18:27.160
Behind that!

18:27.280 --> 18:29.950
FIRE
EXTINGUISHER
STORAGE

18:30.580 --> 18:32.699
It's 11:57.

18:32.700 --> 18:34.100
FIRE
EXTINGUISHER
STORAGE

18:34.101 --> 18:38.329
If the president was right, everyone should
go back to normal in three minutes.

18:38.330 --> 18:39.750
Here's hoping...

18:40.630 --> 18:43.629
Fuuri, you don't have
any more snacks, right?

18:43.630 --> 18:45.130
No, I don't.

18:45.340 --> 18:47.590
You're not hiding a meat bun or something?

18:48.550 --> 18:50.260
I'm telling you, I've got nothing.

18:53.060 --> 18:55.140
They're here. And coming this way!

18:56.640 --> 19:00.020
But why? We don't have any more snacks.

19:00.520 --> 19:05.779
Maybe they ate all the snacks and
now they'll eat US! Oh, man!

19:05.780 --> 19:07.200
Oh, no!

19:07.660 --> 19:09.370
Run for it! This way!

19:10.160 --> 19:12.030
So hungry...

19:20.920 --> 19:22.880
Suzu, what time is it?

19:23.300 --> 19:25.379
It... It's after midnight.

19:25.380 --> 19:26.380
Oh, no!

19:27.050 --> 19:29.010
They should've turned back by now.

19:29.930 --> 19:33.720
Things aren't looking good for us!

19:34.470 --> 19:36.769
Nico... Fuuri...

19:36.770 --> 19:37.809
Suzu?

19:37.810 --> 19:39.060
What is it?

19:39.440 --> 19:45.860
We've been together as First Astronomical
Velocity... and we're going to stay together!

19:46.320 --> 19:49.279
Even in heaven, the three
of us will keep rocking out!

19:49.280 --> 19:50.070
Suzu!

19:50.071 --> 19:52.660
Don't give up now!

19:52.950 --> 20:00.920
I'm not giving up. I'm going to go take them on.
While I'm doing that, you two will run for it!

20:01.580 --> 20:03.419
Suzu, you can't!

20:03.420 --> 20:07.800
That's right. It was YOU who just
said we have to stick together!

20:08.170 --> 20:09.170
But...!

20:13.260 --> 20:15.810
I don't want to give up.

20:17.020 --> 20:22.059
I want to stay with you
both. Together, forever!

20:22.060 --> 20:23.769
N-Nico...

20:23.770 --> 20:25.270
Don't tell me...

20:25.570 --> 20:29.200
We're going to keep being a rock band!

20:34.990 --> 20:36.619
What are you doing?!

20:36.620 --> 20:37.620
Huh?

20:37.790 --> 20:39.460
Don't do anything foolish!

20:40.040 --> 20:41.040
They're...

20:41.330 --> 20:42.540
back to...

20:43.670 --> 20:48.090
NORMAL!

20:55.050 --> 20:56.260
Suzu.

20:57.100 --> 20:58.390
Fuuri.

21:01.230 --> 21:05.690
It's like, well... I'm sorry.

21:06.270 --> 21:07.980
I swear!
Jeez.

21:34.590 --> 21:38.640
Ima no boku wa mou hitori ja nai
I'm not alone anymore

21:39.600 --> 21:43.730
Datte kimi ga ite kureru
Because you're here with me

21:44.440 --> 21:46.270
Nightmare buster

21:46.730 --> 21:49.359
Yami o terasu kotodama
Words of power that light the darkness

21:49.360 --> 21:51.190
Nightmare buster

21:51.360 --> 21:53.860
Ano koro no boku no kokoro mo
You took the heart of who I was

21:54.070 --> 21:56.199
Tokihanarete kureta ne
And set it free for me

21:56.200 --> 22:00.830
Kore kara saki mo soba ni ite!
Keep staying here at my side!

22:01.040 --> 22:05.250
Katazu o nomu kiki to higeki no uzu A
nail-biting whirlwind of danger and tragedy

22:05.620 --> 22:10.170
Yukute ni hirogaru yami o kirihiraite Cut
through the darkness that spreads out ahead

22:10.800 --> 22:14.880
Kizutsuku koto, mou osorenaide!
Don't be scared of being hurt anymore!

22:15.300 --> 22:19.510
Nigirishimeta kimi no te no nukumori ga ima
I've grasped your hand, and its warmth

22:19.850 --> 22:24.640
Boku o atatame, muteki ni suru kara
Warms me and makes me invincible

22:24.980 --> 22:29.150
Kimi to nara, donna ima mo If it's with
you, then no matter what the present

22:29.360 --> 22:32.820
Nurikaete asu e
We'll change it, and toward a new tomorrow

22:33.570 --> 22:34.970
Tomo ni hashire!
We'll run together!

22:43.160 --> 22:48.000
With everyone back to normal,
we were soon rescued without incident.

22:49.130 --> 22:54.130
Shibou Moelle was never released, naturally,
due to its obvious side effects...

22:54.380 --> 22:59.260
and Ouka's commercial debut was a washout.

23:00.260 --> 23:04.100
As for what became of Ouka...

23:08.230 --> 23:10.770
G-gotta hurry back to the agency.

23:11.360 --> 23:17.990
The Age of Ouka has finally come. For
the principal actor to go missing now...

23:18.410 --> 23:22.790
that wouldn't be funny at all!

23:24.960 --> 23:32.960
Next Episode Preview

23:37.020 --> 23:39.980
Star Rain
